  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summer Breeze by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Welcome to Summer Breeze. Aptly named, discover the allure of this delightful beachside haven, meticulously renovated. Designed for both mental repose and quality time with loved ones, Summer Breeze assures a tranquil retreat amidst the stunning scenery.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Blue Mountain Beach<br>👣 30 steps to Private Deeded Beach Access<br>👙 Private pool and spa! (optional heat)<br>🐶 Pet-friendly!<br>🛌 6 bedrooms<br>☕️ Several large wrap-around balconies<br>🦞 Restaurants<br>🛍️ Shops<br> <br>The beach is right across the street (30A), on the other side of the beachfront homes, with public beach access just a few steps away! The second-level patio, with park bench, picnic table, and rocking chairs, faces the gulf, providing a wonderful setting to enjoy the sound of the waves crashing in the distance. Two long driveways and multiple access points ensure utmost convenience.<br><br>And out back? Seven sun-loungers invite you to bask in the summer sun next to the gorgeous private pool! The entertainment area also features a spa, large TV, and comfy seating, making it an ideal spot to unwind, just steps away from the serene Blue Mountain Beach.<br><br>Nearby, stairs lead to a third-floor deck (observation tower?), prime for sunrise and sunset viewing!<br><br>Inside is a gorgeous kitchen and dining room on the first level. On the other side of the kitchen is a comfortable living area with a sleeper sofa, large TV, and desk. The first level also includes a bunk room, with four twins, a guest room, king, and a primary bedroom, king. <br><br>A mirrored layout unfolds on the second level, revealing an expansive kitchen, a large dining table, and a comfortable living area with a sleeper sofa. Nearby is a primary bedroom, king, guest bedroom, king, and a bunk room with four twins, each with TV and bathroom.<br><br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Oversee 30A, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br><br>Overview:<br>- Across the street is the deeded beach access <br>- 6 bedrooms, 5 full bathrooms; 1 half bath<br>- 3750 sq ft<br>- 8 parking spots<br>- Gas grill<br>- Complimentary Wi-Fi<br>- Private pool and spa (can be seasonally heated for an additional $65.00 per day, contact Oversee for details)<br>- Several large wrap-around balconies<br>- Dogs considered, an additional $210 nonrefundable fee for each dog<br><br>Overnight:<br>- King in 1st floor primary bedroom; full private bath; walk-in shower; TV<br>- King in 1st floor guest room; private bath; walk-in shower; TV<br>- 4 twin bunks in 1st-floor guest room; private bath with walk-in shower<br>- Pull-out sleeper sofa in 1st-floor den<br>- King in 2nd floor primary; private bath; walk-in shower; TV<br>- King in 2nd floor guest room; private bath; walk-in shower; TV<br>- 4 twin bunks in 2nd floor guest room; shared bath with walk-in shower; TV<br>- Full-size pull-out sleeper sofa in 2nd floor common area<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Deeded Beach Access - Private Pool - Summer Specials!"
        }
      ],
